==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Countess Koryessa]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Archbaron Face]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] with your [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] to win.

